WEBVTT

00:04:00.556 --> 00:04:05.156
Now, according to Nobel Peace Prize
recipient neuroscientist Eric Kandel,

00:04:05.196 --> 00:04:08.796
he argues that up to 90 percent
of the brain's behavior

00:04:08.836 --> 00:04:10.276
is actually unconscious.

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:12.516
So these little shortcuts
that the brain makes,

00:04:12.516 --> 00:04:16.316
these little implicit
associations, these biases,

00:04:16.356 --> 00:04:19.796
for the most part,
they are done unconsciously.

00:04:21.396 --> 00:04:22.756
And here's the thing.

00:04:22.796 --> 00:04:25.676
Inherent societal privilege

00:04:25.716 --> 00:04:28.716
means that some of us
are given a head start

00:04:28.756 --> 00:04:31.436
in what I like to call the race of life.